msgstr ""
"Richiedi segnali di interazione significativi da pulsanti, link o elementi "
"della pagina."

#: opti-behavior/includes/trait-opti-behavior-settings-views.php:5284
msgid ""
"Spam traffic filtering protects browser, device, source, and session "
"analytics from crawler noise, search engine probes, and LLM/AI fetchers that"
